{"answer_text":"Use one pipeline per sales motion (new business, expansion, partners), share stage definitions, and report across all of them. Tools that handle multiple pipelines well:\n\n**Northwind CRM**\nMature pipeline management, custom stages and strong revenue reporting.\n\n**Pipewell**\nStrong pipeline analytics and rotting-deal alerts that keep reps honest.\n\n**Tallyfox**\nMultiple pipelines per workspace and a clean deal timeline; forecasting is basic but accurate for small books of business.\n\nNorthwind CRM is the safest default here; Pipewell is worth a look if forecasting matters most.","answer_uid":"01a1f315-50cb-7015-92ad-b31be9326a8e","brand_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a260bfb8c145","collection_mode":"api","cost_usd":0.006,"created_at":"2026-11-18T08:01:01.250Z","engine":"google_ai_mode","extraction_status":"ok","extras":null,"fanouts":["multiple sales pipelines best practice","crm multiple pipelines reporting"],"latency_ms":13180,"location_applied":true,"market_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-88a0332cede9","market_name":"United States","mentions":[{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889a7fe6de41","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Northwind CRM","name_text":"Northwind CRM","offsets":[[173,186],[486,499]],"pos":1,"recommended":true,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dcb-71a4-8ae3-889b1141e640","homonym":false,"is_subject":false,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Pipewell","name_text":"Pipewell","offsets":[[264,272],[528,536]],"pos":2,"recommended":false,"relation":"direct","sentiment":"positive","sentiment_reason":"Presented as a strong option with concrete strengths."},{"entity_id":"01a1f315-4dca-7769-a972-a264dfde4e61","homonym":false,"is_subject":true,"list_rank":null,"method":"alias","name":"Tallyfox","name_text":"Tallyfox","offsets":[[351,359]],"pos":3,"recommended":false,"relation":"self